msgstr "यदि किसी संचालन को उप-संचालनों में विभाजित किया गया है, तो उन्हें यहाँ जोड़ा जा सकता है।"

#. Description of the 'Account' (Link) field in DocType 'Warehouse'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/warehouse/warehouse.json:92
msgid "If blank, parent Warehouse Account or company default will be considered in transactions"
msgstr "यदि रिक्त, मूल वेयरहाउस खाता या कंपनी डिफ़ॉल्ट लेनदेन में विचार किया जाएगा"

#. Description of the 'Bill for Rejected Quantity in Purchase Invoice' (Check)
#. field in DocType 'Buying Settings'
#: erpnext/buying/doctype/buying_settings/buying_settings.json:133
msgid "If checked, Rejected Quantity will be included while making Purchase Invoice from Purchase Receipt."
msgstr ""

#. Description of the 'Reserve Stock' (Check) field in DocType 'Sales Order'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/sales_order/sales_order.json:1641
msgid "If checked, Stock will be reserved on <b>Submit</b>"
msgstr "यदि चुना गया है, तो <b>जमा करें</b> पर स्टॉक आरक्षित किया जाएगा।"

#. Description of the 'Scan Mode' (Check) field in DocType 'Pick List'
#: erpnext/stock/doctype/pick_list/pick_list.json:160
msgid "If checked, picked qty won't automatically be fulfilled on submit of pick list."
msgstr "यदि चिह्नित है, तो पिक की गई मात्रा पिक सूची जमा करने पर स्वचालित रूप से पूर्ण नहीं होगी।"

#. Description of the 'Considered In Paid Amount' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Purchase Taxes and Charges'
#. 'Sales Taxes and Charges'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_taxes_and_charges/purchase_taxes_and_charges.json:227
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_taxes_and_charges/sales_taxes_and_charges.json:204
msgid "If checked, the tax amount will be considered as already included in the Paid Amount in Payment Entry"
msgstr "यदि चिह्नित है, तो कर राशि को भुगतान प्रविष्टि में भुगतान की गई राशि में पहले से शामिल माना जाएगा"

#. Description of the 'Is this Tax included in Basic Rate?' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Purchase Taxes and Charges'
#. DocType 'Sales Taxes and Charges'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/purchase_taxes_and_charges/purchase_taxes_and_charges.json:82
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/sales_taxes_and_charges/sales_taxes_and_charges.json:96
msgid "If checked, the tax amount will be considered as already included in the Print Rate / Print Amount"
msgstr "अगर जाँच की है, कर की राशि के रूप में पहले से ही प्रिंट दर / प्रिंट राशि में शामिल माना जाएगा"

#: erpnext/public/js/setup_wizard.js:57
